# MadGraph5 batch script: e+ e- > t t~ NP^2==2
# in SMEFTsim_topU3l_MwScheme (UFO v3.0.2), restricted by restrict_massless.dat.
#
# Why this exact process:
#   The capstone row's process (ee_to_ttx_smeft) under a squared-order constraint:
#   the terms whose NP orders sum to two: NP^1 x NP^1 and the SM x NP^2
#   interference of the double insertions the implied NP<=2 admits.
#   The line has no amplitude order, so MadGraph bounds it at NP<=2
#   (madgraph_interface.py:4994-4999). Every other choice -- model, restrict card,
#   beams -- is the capstone's, so the two rows differ only in the selection.
#
# The model path is repo-relative to the vendored UFO; build.sh rewrites it to
# the work-area copy it stages under output/models/.
import model validation/ufo/SMEFTsim_topU3l_MwScheme_UFO-massless
display interactions
generate e+ e- > t t~ NP^2==2
output ee_to_ttx_np2 -nojpeg
launch
set lpp1 0
set lpp2 0
set ebeam1 250
set ebeam2 250
set use_syst False
done
